# docs — `mkdocs build` output. NEVER commit this: it is ~12MB of rendered HTML
# plus a copy of every asset, regenerated on every content change, and git keeps
# each copy forever. CI builds it from docs/ and uploads it straight to Pages,
# so nothing needs it in the tree. (Same rule as the app binaries above: sources
# are committed, build products are not.)
site/
